ublk: add kernel data structures for buffer pools

Add ublk_buf (a single selected buffer), ublk_buf_pool (per-queue pool
with head/tail ring and optional pinning state), and extend ublk_queue
with the buf_pools array and ublk_io with sel_buf.

These structures follow the same model as fuse's fuse_bufring: per-queue,
kernel-managed head/tail, no cross-queue sharing.

